# Testing

After any code change, run the API unit tests before considering the task done. Do not wait for the user to ask.

```bash
docker compose exec api pip install -q -r requirements-dev.txt
docker compose exec api pytest
```

If Docker is not running, from `apps/api` with the venv active:

```bash
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
pytest
```

Fix failing tests before moving on.
